:"e37d9859-a3e5-45bc-833b-48fd355bd17b","position":{"commit_sha":"caf67a0c8cde9e78ea4818a464c1152c5a01d228","position":"1784757160873662001-e37d9859-a3e5-45bc-833b-48fd355bd17b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Story 5967 Gerrit #889 merged after LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, and zero unresolved comments. GitHub mirror contains merged commit 94e605a29d21f9a5fe196734392c6dba9b6fc7fe. Continuing from fresh worktree /private/tmp/rebar-jira-reb-1160-cont4 at origin/main for close verification.","timestamp":1784747173557596001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Continuation milestone: story 5967-4476-7f9f-442d merged as Gerrit 889 / mirror 94e605a2 and closed after completion verification. Claimed 2bbd-87f6-8765-4b00 for the next leaf. Updated rebar-implement skill reloaded from origin/main; orchestrator remains strong tier for oracle design/validation, planned implementer tier is standard because this is a multi-file transaction and policy integration.","timestamp":1784747794923512001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"2bbd oracle contract: authoritative source is the reviewed ticket plan and delivered PlanValidityProfile.CLOSE contract; production paths are close_plan_review_gate_check, public transition close, and txn.transition_core; unit plus real temporary-store lifecycle tiers are required because the policy crosses config/signature/validity and the transaction lock; exact postconditions are preserved validity verdicts, review-plan remediation, unchanged in_progress state, and zero STATUS append on locked rejection; controls are disabled/exempt/force/omitted-callback paths; gate is make test. RED evidence: 21 new-behavior failures for missing close_plan_review_gate_check/pre_status_check/wiring, all for the intended absent behavior; the omitted-callback compatibility control already passes.","timestamp":1784747916335182001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"2bbd validation milestone: visible happy oracle RED then GREEN; initial held-out suite 22/22 GREEN on first run. Under-lock callback defect-seeded mutation made both transaction and lifecycle race tests RED, restored to GREEN. Code review found a zero-network gap: CLOSE validity entered ensure_fresh. Added a behavioral RED oracle, redispatched same standard tier once, then simplified to one ContextVar-based local_read_context at the canonical ensure_fresh boundary; signature, own-material, and related-pin reads are now locally scoped without changing default readers or full signing/attest modules. Final focused suite 167/167 GREEN and make check PASS. Broad xdist run: 6920 passed, 28 skipped, one pre-existing schema-test contradiction; tracked/claimed as e833-965d-13de-43a2 and fixed RED->GREEN with a required-field negative control.","timestamp":1784750895002042001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Resumed after background terminals stopped. Gerrit changes 893 (e833 schema regression) and 894 (2bbd close-time review enforcement) are open at patch set 1; both CI runs started, no votes yet, zero unresolved comments. Correct Gerrit REST authentication uses git credential fill for rebar.solutions.navateam.com; curl --netrc returns 401 because credentials are stored in the configured Git credential helper, not .netrc. Worktree /private/tmp/rebar-jira-reb-1160-cont4 is clean, ahead two review commits and behind origin/main by one unrelated commit.","timestamp":1784751348916737001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Claimed unblocked story 7c27-10fc-4fe6-4b56 while Gerrit 893/894 gates run. It depends only on already-closed 75de and 5967. Beginning upstream-contract verification and held-out RED oracle design per rebar-implement.","timestamp":1784751437544174001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"7c27 oracle RED confirmed: 12 intended prerequisite-consistency tests fail for absent coverage contract, whole-block packing, fidelity report, batch with_inputs, structured prerequisite identity, and terminal indeterminate precedence; legacy finding-ID negative control passes unchanged. Moving held-out edge tests outside the implementation worktree; implementer will see only tests/unit/test_plan_review_prerequisites.py.","timestamp":1784751630636416001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Gerrit milestone: changes 893 and 894 both earned LLM-Review +1 with zero unresolved comments. Verified remains 0 while CI matrices finish; no completed CI job has failed.","timestamp":1784752037154946001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"7c27 implementer handoff validated independently: restored held-out oracle outside implementer view; all 13 happy+edge tests GREEN on first held-out run. Defect-seeded mutation restoring blocking-before-prerequisite-indeterminate made the terminal-precedence held-out test RED, then restoration returned it GREEN. Implementer evidence also reports singleton and packed evals both recall=1.0 false_accept=0.0 coverage=1.0 attribution_errors=0.0.","timestamp":1784752552488913001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Gerrit changes 893 and 894 reached LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, zero unresolved comments, and were submitted together at 2026-07-22 20:41:48Z. Both report MERGED. Waiting for origin/main mirror replication before closing e833 and 2bbd.","timestamp":1784752922229108001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"7c27 post-rebase: 118 focused tests and make check GREEN. Broad suite found missing CONTRACT_SCHEMAS registration; existing schema coverage test RED, fixed, 17 focused GREEN, make check GREEN. Amended 0f284b4ab and pushed Gerrit 899 (I4b52adda9318e3471bb15b426e34a4f79801afa4). Broad rerun active; awaiting LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, and no unresolved comments.","timestamp":1784754024455800001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"7c27 Gerrit 899 PS2 f4dc5cf17: broad run 6948 pass/58 skip found 3 real rebase gaps (threshold routing expectation, blocking set expectation, precheck backward compatibility); all fixed, focused 26 GREEN, make check GREEN. Teardown error was caused solely by amending HEAD during pytest. Starting final broad rerun with HEAD fixed.","timestamp":1784755452628676001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"7c27 PS2 f4dc5cf17 final broad validation GREEN: 6951 passed, 58 skipped, 0 failed; HEAD fixed throughout. Awaiting Gerrit 899 two-vote gate.","timestamp":1784757160873662001}],"created_at":1784747168200744001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summa